          "answer": "(a) $h'(x)$: zero at $x=-4,-2,1$; positive on $(-\\infty,-4)$ and $(-2,1)$; negative on $(-4,-2)$ and $(1,\\infty)$.\n(b) $h(-x)$: reflection in $y$-axis; max at $x=4$, min at $x=2$, max at $x=-1$.",
